# Frontend stack (Valentia)

Documented standards (install when implementing — not necessarily present yet):

| Concern | Standard | Skill |
|---------|----------|--------|
| Framework | Next.js 16 App Router + React 19 | `nextjs-16` |
| Forms | react-hook-form + Zod | `form-validation` |
| Server state | axios + TanStack Query | `data-fetching` |
| Client/UI state | Zustand | `state-management` |
| Realtime | Socket.IO (Nest ↔ Next) | `realtime-sockets` |
| UI kit | shadcn / Tailwind v4 / Phosphor | `frontend-design`, `ui-ux-pro-max` |
| React patterns | — | `react-dev`, `react-useeffect` |

## Rules

- **No raw hex in components** — use tokens from `design.md`.
- Server state in Query; UI state in Zustand; do not duplicate.
- Labels on forms; field-level Zod errors; never trust client for payment/workflow truth.
- Prefer Nest as the domain API; keep Next Route Handlers thin if used at all.

Also follow `client-next.mdc` / `dashboard-next.mdc` for app-specific notes.
